        {
            "id": "a003_046_0000",
            "en_US": "Your favorite is {VAR 0101 0000}, isn't it?"
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_046_0001",
            "en_US": "Your favorite is that Egg, isn't it?"
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_046_0002",
            "en_US": "Yes, I was right! I thought so!"
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_046_0003",
            "en_US": "What? Your favorite isn't {VAR 0101 0000}?!"
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_046_0004",
            "en_US": [
                "...Oh? Your favorite really is that Egg,\n",
                "isn't it?"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_046_0005",
            "en_US": [
                "I want to know\n",
                "everyone's favorite kind of Pokémon!"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_046_0006",
            "en_US": [
                "When you're tired, take a rest!\n",
                "It's the same for people and Pokémon."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_046_0007",
            "en_US": [
                "Wanna recover Pokémon?\n",
                "Oh, soooooorry!{VAR BE01}"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_046_0008",
            "en_US": "Do you know Geonet?"
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_046_0009",
            "en_US": [
                "You! You, using Geonet! Great!\n",
                "I tell you this in confidence.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "With the latest technology, we can trade\n",
                "Pokémon with people far away!{VAR BE01}\n",
                "...I know it sounds crazy,\n",
                "but give it a try. You'll be surprised!"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_046_0010",
            "en_US": [
                "Oh! You know Geonet!\n",
                "Great, great!{VAR BE01}\n",
                "This is even greater, lemme tell ya!{VAR BE01}\n",
                "If you try Geonet, you can register\n",
                "the place where you live!"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_046_0011",
            "en_US": [
                "You see the globe on the second floor\n",
                "of this Pokémon Center?{VAR BE01}\n",
                "That is Geonet.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "If you check on Geonet, you can register\n",
                "the place where you live!"
            ]
        }
    ]
